anti_cheese = "Kasiski is unreliable here: for some key words the repeats point at the key length or a multiple, for EMBERS they point the wrong way (3). The free Column Loom's IoC vial is the dependable route (prefer the smallest N whose vial runs thick; multiples of the key length also score high). As on puzzle 8 the stepper and tallies are free, and every drum notch costs Thirst; one or two strands per key need a less common read (the tallest bar as S or H, or the second-tallest bar), so expect about 12-30 Thirst (Stained) depending on the key."
